Modifications in this repository:
- Base URL is configurable (~/.sentryclirc [defaults] url, SENTRY_URL, --url),
  so the scripts also work against GlitchTip and other Sentry-compatible servers.
- Backend detection (sentry vs glitchtip) with per-backend request building for
  issue listing and log search, and a clear refusal for Discover-only features.
- Added scripts/check-config.js; org/project defaults read from the rc file.
- A .sentryclirc in the working directory is layered over ~/.sentryclirc,
  matching sentry-cli's own config lookup.
